changes={
'UI-01':('Mitigated; delivery blocked','Removed unconditional success/reset. Added configurable JSON POST, confirmed-reference receipt, pending/error feedback, retained values and phone assistance. A production endpoint, server validation, storage and delivery still need to be supplied.'),
'UI-02':('Fixed','Restored required-field and format validation. Invalid submissions show inline guidance and never enter the sending path.'),
'UI-03':('Pending authoritative eligibility','Official Programs prose, its age table, Admissions and application choices conflict. Removed unsupported universal eligibility claims and automatic age-band rejection; retained published program bands as information. The school must confirm campus/program entry rules.'),
'UI-04':('Mitigated; destinations blocked','Replaced misleading login/download promises with Request Web Portal Access, Request iOS App Link and Request Android App Link actions to Contact. Verified login and store URLs are still needed.'),
'UI-05':('Mitigated; documents blocked','Relabelled placeholder links as Request Privacy Policy and Request Terms of Service and directed them to Contact. No approved policy text was available, so no legal documents were invented or published.'),
'UI-06':('Fixed','Removed generic platform-homepage icons and their empty wrappers. Real profiles can be restored when verified URLs are supplied.'),
'UI-07':('Fixed','Drawer opening moves focus to Close; closing returns focus to its trigger. Background content is inert while the dialog is open.'),
'UI-08':('Fixed','Shared controller gives navigation, search, video and detail dialogs initial focus, Tab/Shift+Tab containment, background isolation and focus return. Dialog visibility transitions no longer block focus.'),
'UI-09':('Fixed','Search now displays matching page links or a no-matches message while preserving the query. Removed silent redirection to About.'),
'UI-10':('Fixed by removing unsupported choice','Removed the nonfunctional language selector. No Arabic version is claimed; a translated version can be added separately.'),
'UI-11':('Fixed','Booking guidance paragraph now uses white on dark teal (approximately 12.03:1).'),
'UI-12':('Fixed for affected accent text and controls','Kept the decorative coral palette, added a darker text token on light surfaces and dark teal text on coral actions. Dark surfaces retain light accents. Rendered checks cover affected labels, buttons and the booking paragraph; this is not a complete accessibility certification.'),
'UI-13':('Fixed in the frontend','Bound child birth dates to today in Asia/Muscat and reject past tour dates. Published schedule age ranges do not trigger rejection without school confirmation. Added timezone and campus-hours guidance. Server enforcement remains part of the delivery-service dependency.'),
'UI-14':('Fixed','Document readiness boxes start unchecked and explicitly do not upload files. Application and Admissions now direct families to arrange delivery with their campus, with no invented upload capability.'),
'UI-15':('Fixed','Removed the outdated Summer Camp 2026 option. The current academic-year option remains.'),
'UI-16':('Fixed','Application now has six steps with progress, per-step validation, Back/Edit controls, a review summary, local draft download/resume, and an unsaved-change guard. Drafts are not automatically stored in the browser.'),
'UI-17':('Fixed','Contact now starts with inquiry type. Child birth date is optional and shown only for enrollment. Other topics exclude child data from submission; messages allow 2000 characters with a live counter.'),
'UI-18':('Fixed','Both campus cards now offer directions using their displayed postal addresses. These are address-based map requests, not independently verified map pins.'),
'UI-19':('Fixed','About, Programs and Enrichments now share a compact 44–72px section spacing scale and 36px section-heading gaps.'),
'UI-20':('Fixed','Spaces includes three real school photographs with descriptions, full-size image links and an action to book a campus visit. Captions do not assign unverified campus locations.'),
'UI-21':('Fixed','The final admission step explains what to confirm with the selected campus and links to a Fees inquiry with its message prefilled. No fee amount, payment policy or deadline was invented; only the verified campus contact path is offered.'),
'UI-22':('Fixed','Booking, Parents and Contact now have prominent first-viewport task links. Booking and contact forms precede supporting content on mobile. Parent actions prefill the corresponding inquiry.'),
'UI-23':('Fixed','Closed dialogs and collapsed navigation submenus are inert and excluded from keyboard focus.'),
'UI-24':('Fixed','Video play/pause events synchronize both the visible button text and its accessible name.')}
