md=['# UI fix verification — 15 October 2026','Scope: implement all local UI fixes and all seven previously deferred UX recommendations. Twenty findings have their local UI work addressed; four external integration/content dependencies remain mitigated. The user clarified website UI work and subsequently required issue ownership, authoritative content and independent verification. Root exclusively owns source integration; three subagents own read-only verification.','## Verification',f'Current-source production build passed. All {len(tests)} behavior/layout checks passed across 10 pages, 70 navigation sections, 16 detail cards and four viewport sizes (320, 390, 768 and 1440 pixels). Current UI tests cover application validation, review, draft round-trips, invalid-draft retention, inquiry routing, failed submissions and confirmed receipts. Earlier isolated submission tests covered the other network error paths. No real application was sent. All {sum(len(p["checks"]) for p in contrast)} measured affected accent/text contrast checks passed. The earlier isolated timeout check remains at audit-results/fixes-2026-10-15/timeout.json. No physical iOS/Android device was available; safe-area, input-size and touch rules were checked in code and Chrome emulation.','Evidence: [browser checks](audit-results/complete-ui-2026-10-15/verification.json), [contrast measurements](audit-results/complete-ui-2026-10-15/contrast.json), [earlier timeout check](audit-results/fixes-2026-10-15/timeout.json), [exact file manifest](audit-results/complete-ui-2026-10-15/file-manifest.json).','## Remaining dependencies','- UI-01: production submission endpoint and its delivery/storage/validation service. Set the public VITE_SUBMISSION_ENDPOINT after deploying the service; see SUBMISSION_INTEGRATION.md.\n- UI-04: verified parent login, iOS and Android store URLs.\n- UI-05: school-approved privacy policy and terms content.\n- UI-03: authoritative, consistent campus/program eligibility rules.','These gaps are visible in the UI. Submission is explicitly unavailable while no service is configured, retains entries and provides campus phone links. App and policy actions request help rather than claiming a working destination.','## Ownership and independent verification','Root exclusively owned website source and integration. Three subagents performed read-only reviews and wrote only their assigned evidence directories. See [ownership and acceptance](audit-results/complete-ui-2026-10-15/ownership-and-acceptance.md), [forms review](audit-results/complete-ui-2026-10-15/forms-review/review.md), [accessibility review](audit-results/complete-ui-2026-10-15/accessibility-review/REPORT.md), and [content review](audit-results/complete-ui-2026-10-15/content-review/content-verification.md). Production release is blocked by UI-01 and authoritative content dependencies.','## Findings']
for r in rows:md.extend([f'### {r["id"]} — {r["status"]}',r['detail']])
md+=['## Exact source files changed', '\n'.join('- '+f'[{p}]({p})' for p in source_files),'## Test and report files','\n'.join('- '+f'[{p}]({p})' for p in work_files),'Generated captures and machine-readable evidence are individually listed in file-manifest.json. Existing dist output and unrelated work were not rebuilt or reset; production verification builds were written under /tmp.','## Sources and limits','The published [school program table](https://shomoukh.com/) was used to align age wording. The public [Parents page](https://shomoukh.com/parents) did not provide independently verifiable app/login destinations. Policy content and production service access were not available. Browser checks used Chrome emulation. Physical-device validation of keyboard, safe-area and touch behavior remains unverified because no hardware session was available.']
(root/'UI_COMPLETE_VERIFICATION_2026-10-15.md').write_text('\n\n'.join(md)+'\n')
