parts=[f'<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"><title>UI fix verification</title><style>{style}</style><main><h1>UI fix verification</h1><p>15 October 2026 · 20 UI findings addressed · 4 external integration/content dependencies</p><section><h2>Verification</h2><p>Production build and all {len(tests)} browser checks passed. Covered ten pages at four sizes, all 70 navigation sections, all 16 enrichment cards, search, focus management, application steps, local draft save/resume, contextual inquiries and mocked receipt handling.</p><p>All {sum(len(p["checks"]) for p in contrast)} measured affected accent/text contrast checks passed. No real applications were sent.</p><p><a href="verification.json">Browser evidence</a> · <a href="contrast.json">Contrast evidence</a> · <a href="../fixes-2026-10-15/timeout.json">Earlier timeout evidence</a> · <a href="file-manifest.json">Exact file manifest</a> · <a href="../inspection-2026-10-15/report.html">Original inspection</a></p></section><section class="pending"><h2>Remaining dependencies</h2><p><strong>Eligibility:</strong> official school pages conflict; campus/program entry rules need authoritative confirmation. No automated age-based rejection is applied.</p><p><strong>Submission delivery:</strong> supply a production endpoint; the UI now preserves entries and clearly reports unavailable service.</p><p><strong>Parent platforms:</strong> supply verified login and app-store URLs; actions now explicitly request the relevant link.</p><p><strong>Policies:</strong> supply approved privacy and terms documents; actions now request those documents through Contact.</p></section><section><h2>Independent reviews</h2><p><a href="forms-review/review.md">Forms: 38/38 checks</a> · <a href="accessibility-review/REPORT.md">Accessibility: 62/62 behavior, 136/136 contrast, 8/8 focus</a> · <a href="content-review/content-verification.md">Authoritative content review</a> · <a href="ownership-and-acceptance.md">Ownership, acceptance criteria and blockers</a> · <a href="source-hashes.json">Final source hashes</a></p><h2>Finding status</h2>']
